WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.073 --> 00:00:18.155
gasped for breath beside a temple column.

2
00:00:18.175 --> 00:00:23.859
"I wish Vinnie were here," she said.

3
00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.042
Jason and Vinnie headed toward the Parthenon.

4
00:00:28.703 --> 00:00:30.184
But Socrates stopped them.

5
00:00:32.012 --> 00:00:36.236
"It may not be wise to enter the temple," Socrates warned.

6
00:00:36.256 --> 00:00:40.199
"Great Socrates," said Jason, bowing.

7
00:00:40.219 --> 00:00:45.543
"Why?" "That name sounds familiar," thought Vinnie.

8
00:00:45.563 --> 00:00:52.989
"Inside, a young girl is holding a strange light," Socrates said.

9
00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:54.991
It was Mandy!

10
00:00:55.011 --> 00:00:59.174
"Jason, that's my sister," Vinnie said.

11
00:00:59.194 --> 00:01:01.116
"She won't harm anyone."

12
00:01:02.292 --> 00:01:05.194
"But Socrates said cried Jason.

13
00:01:05.214 --> 00:01:07.555
"He doesn't understand.

14
00:01:08.355 --> 00:01:10.897
We both need your help," said Vinnie.

15
00:01:11.477 --> 00:01:13.638
He looked straight into Jason's eyes.

16
00:01:13.658 --> 00:01:17.520
"Then I will help you, Vinnie," Jason said.

17
00:01:18.661 --> 00:01:20.802
Together they ran up the stairs.

18
00:01:20.822 --> 00:01:24.524
"Mandy!" Vinnie called.

19
00:01:24.544 --> 00:01:26.766
"Vinnie! You're here!"

20
00:01:27.486 --> 00:01:28.166
she cried.

21
00:01:28.967 --> 00:01:30.928
Vinnie took the photo from Mandy.

22
00:01:33.148 --> 00:01:35.670
"Look! The helmet is glowing brighter!"

23
00:01:36.351 --> 00:01:37.111
Vinnie said.

24
00:01:37.131 --> 00:01:39.493
"Where is the statue?"

25
00:01:40.174 --> 00:01:41.115
cried Mandy.

26
00:01:41.135 --> 00:01:43.917
"I thought it was in the Parthenon!"

27
00:01:46.479 --> 00:01:47.920
Jason stepped forward.

28
00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:49.262
"It is here.

29
00:01:49.662 --> 00:01:51.663
I can take you," he said.

30
00:01:52.644 --> 00:01:54.406
He was glad Mandy was safe.

31
00:01:54.426 --> 00:01:58.229
"On the way, I will tell you the story of Athena."

32
00:02:00.631 --> 00:02:04.873
As Jason talked, the children passed scenes carved on the walls.

33
00:02:06.034 --> 00:02:08.235
Some scenes showed men in chariots.

34
00:02:09.435 --> 00:02:12.937
Another scene showed girls carrying water for the goddess.

35
00:02:15.518 --> 00:02:21.281
"Both Athena and the god of the sea wanted to rule our city," Jason said.

36
00:02:21.301 --> 00:02:25.282
"So they decided to hold a gift-giving contest.

37
00:02:26.183 --> 00:02:28.824
The god of the sea gave the city water.

38
00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:32.801
But it was salty.

39
00:02:33.541 --> 00:02:35.582
Athena's gift was an olive tree.

40
00:02:36.442 --> 00:02:38.223
This tree gave people food.

41
00:02:38.923 --> 00:02:41.144
The people of Athens were very happy.

42
00:02:42.225 --> 00:02:45.286
Athena won and became the goddess of the city."

43
00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:50.968
At last they stopped in front of the statue of Athena.

44
00:02:51.509 --> 00:02:52.409
It was huge!

45
00:02:52.429 --> 00:02:56.311
"Wow!" Mandy cried.

46
00:02:57.371 --> 00:02:58.812
The children were stunned.

47
00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:03.841
The entire sculpture was gold except for the face and arms.

48
00:03:04.881 --> 00:03:07.102
They were white like polished ivory.

49
00:03:07.122 --> 00:03:14.224
"The winged woman in her right hand is Nike," explained Jason.

50
00:03:14.244 --> 00:03:17.805
"She can fly and run faster than anyone.

51
00:03:18.785 --> 00:03:20.686
Nike is the goddess of victory!"

52
00:03:22.827 --> 00:03:25.347
Vinnie took the photo out of his pocket.

53
00:03:26.568 --> 00:03:29.850
In the photo, Athena's helmet was glowing red.

54
00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:32.532
The light hurt the children's eyes.

55
00:03:32.552 --> 00:03:34.454
"We're going home!"

56
00:03:35.074 --> 00:03:35.895
Vinnie shouted.

57
00:03:35.915 --> 00:03:38.497
"Good luck at the Olympics, Jason!"

58
00:03:38.517 --> 00:03:42.220
"Vinnie! Mandy!

59
00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:43.801
What is happening?"

60
00:03:44.602 --> 00:03:45.522
Jason shouted.

61
00:03:47.124 --> 00:03:50.767
His voice faded as the children fell through the dark tunnel.

62
00:03:50.787 --> 00:03:57.352
"Ow!" grunted Mandy, as she hit a solid floor.

63
00:03:58.464 --> 00:04:00.666
"Ugh!" moaned Vinnie.

64
00:04:03.128 --> 00:04:04.890
The children opened their eyes.

65
00:04:05.431 --> 00:04:06.912
They were back in the attic.

66
00:04:08.433 --> 00:04:09.594
They heard footsteps.

67
00:04:10.275 --> 00:04:13.378
They quickly shut the album as the door swung open.

68
00:04:13.398 --> 00:04:16.821
"Didn't you hear me calling?"

69
00:04:17.361 --> 00:04:17.982
Dad asked.

70
00:04:18.002 --> 00:04:19.824
"What are you doing up here?"

71
00:04:20.925 --> 00:04:23.907
Vinnie and Mandy looked at each other and smiled.
